      <title>British Medical Association Requires Doctors to Help Patients Commit Suicide by Self-Starvation</title>
      <link>https://www.nationalreview.com/corner/british-medical-association-requires-doctors-to-help-patients-commit-suicide-by-self-starvation/</link>
      <description>The subtitle of the revised and updated version of my book criticizing utilitarian bioethics, Culture of Death, is, "The Age of 'Do Harm' Medicine." Helping patients kill themselves by self-starvation and dehydration -- known in euthanasia parlance as VSED (for voluntary stopping eating and drinking...</description>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><img src="https://i0.wp.com/www.nationalreview.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/hospital-patient-bed-monitor.jpg?fit=617%2C360&ssl=1" style="max-width:100%; height:auto;" /></p><div><html><body><div><div class="
          article-content
          article-content--headless
          article-content--teaser
        "><p>The subtitle of the revised and updated version of my book criticizing utilitarian bioethics, <a href="//www.amazon.com/Culture-Death-Age-Harm%C2%94-Medicine/dp/1594038554/ref=sr_1_1?adgrpid=1339205725349816&amp;dib=eyJ2IjoiMSJ9.Usesa_TCq5Yk14mjRtpfKkUm5VZYFVujT7Cs9tC-4D6RHYqfYmYteNd7cuVkIEjzKnIh3QNVGhJJQQUnomOWq1UJuBb6hBSnUNj5jFAyI3c.PnuH3XuErOfdfd9jpxUVh3iY2GA70TsGG3gg955TY0E&amp;dib_tag=se&amp;gb=2&amp;hvadid=83700596982134&amp;hvbmt=be&amp;hvdev=c&amp;hvexpln=0&amp;hvlocphy=90227&amp;hvnetw=o&amp;hvocijid=1367337277191842659--&amp;hvqmt=e&amp;hvtargid=kwd-83700698420199%3Aloc-190&amp;hydadcr=22592_13494530&amp;keywords=culture+of+death+wesley+j+smith&amp;mcid=ad22f3c28c843c6198e4c1e5a1584e5d&amp;qid=1787099131&amp;sr=8-1" rel="noopener"><em>Culture of Death</em></a>, is, "The Age of 'Do Harm' Medicine." Helping patients kill themselves by self-starvation and dehydration -- known in euthanasia parlance as VSED (for voluntary stopping eating and drinking) -- certainly fits that designation.</p>
<p>Two major medical associations now have endorsed doctors assisting in such suicides by palliating the painful symptoms to help patients go all the way to death. The first was <a href="https://www.jpsmjournal.com/article/S0885-3924(23)00565-1/fulltext" rel="noopener">the American Academy</a> of Hospice and Palliative Medicine (AAHPM) in 2023. This is especially notable because the organization shamefully <a href="https://www.nationalreview.com/human-exceptionalism/abdication-professional-responsibility-lead-wesley-j-smith/" rel="noopener">went "neutral"</a> on <a href="https://www.washingtonexaminer.com/news/1657470/dame-cecily-saunders/" rel="noopener"></a> ...</p>
</div></div></body></html></div>]]></content:encoded>
